Scenario: Add Structure With Subfield
Priority: 4
	Given these properties
		|testray.component.names|Web Content Administration|
	When Navigator open URL
	And ProductMenu goto Sites Content
		|portlet|Web Content|
	And WebContentNavigator goto Manage Structures
	And WebContentStructures add CP
		|structureDescription|WC Structure Description|
		|structureName|WC Structure Name|
	And DynamicDataMapping add Field
		|field|Text|
		|fieldFieldLabel|Text|
		|fieldName|Text|
	And DynamicDataMapping add Field Nested
		|field|Integer|
		|fieldFieldLabel|Integer|
		|fieldName|Integer|
	And WebContentStructures save CP
		|structureName|WC Structure Name|
	And Navigator open URL
	And ProductMenu goto Sites Content
		|portlet|Web Content|
	And WebContentNavigator goto Manage Templates
	And WebContentTemplates add CP
		|templateLanguage|ftl|
		|templateName|WC Template Name|
	And WebContentTemplates add Structure
		|structureName|WC Structure Name|
		|templateFieldNames|Text|
		|templateLanguage|ftl|
	And PortletEntry save
	And Navigator open URL
	And ProductMenu goto Sites Content
		|portlet|Web Content|
	And WebContentNavigator goto Add With Structure CP
		|structureName|WC Structure Name|
	And WebContent add With Structure CP
		|structureName|WC Structure Name|
		|templateName|WC Template Name|
		|webContentInteger|123|
		|webContentText|Text|
		|webContentTitle|WC WebContent Title|
	And PortletEntry publish
	And WebContent view Title
		|webContentTitle|WC WebContent Title|
	And WebContent view With Structure CP
		|webContentText|Text|
		|webContentTitle|WC WebContent Title|
	And WebContent view Nested Field
		|fieldName|Text|
		|nestedField|Integer|
		|nestedFieldData|123|
	And Navigator open URL
	And ProductMenu goto Sites Content
		|portlet|Web Content|
	And WebContentNavigator goto Manage Structures
	And WebContentStructures view CP
		|structureDescription|WC Structure Description|
		|structureName|WC Structure Name|
	And LexiconEntry goto Entry
		|rowEntry|WC Structure Name|
	And DynamicDataMapping view Field
		|fieldFieldLabel|Text|
		|fieldName|Text|
	Then DynamicDataMapping view Field
		|fieldFieldLabel|Integer|
		|fieldName|Integer|
Scenario: Add Structure With Unlocalizable Fields
Priority: 4
	Given these properties
		|testray.component.names|Localization,Web Content Administration|
	When Navigator open URL
	And ProductMenu goto Sites Content
		|portlet|Web Content|
	And WebContentNavigator goto Manage Structures
	And WebContentStructures add CP
		|structureDescription|WC Structure Description|
		|structureName|WC Structure Name|
	And DynamicDataMapping add Field
		|field|Text|
		|fieldFieldLabel|Text|
		|fieldName|StringUtil#replace('Text', ' ', '')|
	And DynamicDataMapping add Field
		|field|Text Box|
		|fieldFieldLabel|Text Box|
		|fieldName|StringUtil#replace('Text Box', ' ', '')|
	And WebContentStructures save CP
		|structureName|WC Structure Name|
	And Navigator open URL
	And ProductMenu goto Sites Content
		|portlet|Web Content|
	And WebContentNavigator goto Manage Structures
	And WebContentNavigator goto Edit Structure
		|structureName|WC Structure Name|
	And DynamicDataMapping edit Field Localizable
		|fieldFieldLabel|Text Box|
	And WebContentStructures save CP
	And Navigator open URL
	And ProductMenu goto Sites Content
		|portlet|Web Content|
	And WebContentNavigator goto Manage Templates
	And WebContentTemplates add CP
		|templateDescription|WC Template Description|
		|templateLanguage|ftl|
		|templateName|WC Template Name|
	And WebContentTemplates add Structure
		|structureName|WC Structure Name|
		|templateFieldNames|Text,Text Box|
		|templateLanguage|ftl|
	And PortletEntry save
	And Navigator open URL
	And ProductMenu goto Sites Content
		|portlet|Web Content|
	And WebContentNavigator goto Add With Structure CP
		|structureName|WC Structure Name|
	And WebContent add With Structure CP
		|structureName|WC Structure Name|
		|templateName|WC Template Name|
		|webContentText|Text|
		|webContentTextBox|Text Box|
		|webContentTitle|WC WebContent Title|
	And PortletEntry publish
	And WebContent view Title
		|webContentTitle|WC WebContent Title|
	And WebContentNavigator goto Edit CP
		|webContentTitle|WC WebContent Title|
	And WebContent add Locale
		|language|Spanish (Spain)|
		|locale|es-ES|
	And WebContent add CP
		|webContentTitle|Title Spanish|
	And FormFields edit Text
		|fieldName|Text|
		|fieldValue|Text Spanish|
	And FormFields edit Text Multiline
		|fieldName|TextBox|
		|fieldValue|Text Box Spanish|
	And PortletEntry publish
	And WebContentNavigator goto Edit CP
		|webContentTitle|WC WebContent Title|
	Then WebContent view Unlocalizable Text Box
		|editLocalizedTextBox|Text Box Unlocalized|
		|localizedText|Text Spanish|
		|localizedTextBox|Text Box|
		|localizedTitle|Title Spanish|
		|webContentTextBox|Text Box|
		|webContentTitle|WC WebContent Title|
Scenario: Add Structure With Web Content And Geolocation Fields
Priority: 5
##########################################################
The Poshi description element is not supported in the readable syntax. Please update this test.
##########################################################
	When these properties
		|testray.component.names|Web Content Administration|
	And Navigator open URL
	And ProductMenu goto Sites Content
		|portlet|Web Content|
	And WebContentNavigator goto Add CP
	And WebContent add CP
		|webContentContent|WC WebContent 1 Content|
		|webContentTitle|WC WebContent 1 Title|
	And PortletEntry publish
	And ProductMenu goto Sites Content
		|portlet|Web Content|
	And WebContentNavigator goto Manage Structures
	And WebContentStructures add CP
		|structureDescription|WC Structure Description|
		|structureName|WC Structure Name|
	And DynamicDataMapping add Field
		|field|Web Content|
		|fieldFieldLabel|Web Content|
		|fieldName|WebContent|
	And DynamicDataMapping add Field
		|field|Geolocation|
		|fieldFieldLabel|Geolocation|
		|fieldName|Geolocation|
	And WebContentStructures save CP
		|structureName|WC Structure Name|
	And Navigator open URL
	And ProductMenu goto Sites Content
		|portlet|Web Content|
	And WebContentNavigator goto Manage Templates
	And WebContentTemplates add CP
		|templateDescription|WC Template Description|
		|templateName|WC Template Name|
	And WebContentTemplates add Structure
		|structureName|WC Structure Name|
	And PortletEntry save
	And Navigator open URL
	And ProductMenu goto Sites Content
		|portlet|Web Content|
	And WebContentNavigator goto Add With Structure CP
		|structureName|WC Structure Name|
	And WebContent add With Structure CP
		|fieldName|WebContent|
		|WebContentSelectWCFile|WC WebContent 1 Title|
		|webContentTitle|WC WebContent 2 Title|
	And PortletEntry publish
	And WebContent view Title
		|webContentTitle|WC WebContent 2 Title|
	And WebContentNavigator goto Edit CP
		|webContentTitle|WC WebContent 2 Title|
	And WebContent view CP Without Content Field
		|field|Web Content|
		|fieldData|WC WebContent 1 Title|
		|fieldFieldLabel|Web Content|
		|fieldName|WebContent|
		|webContentTitle|WC WebContent 2 Title|
	Then WebContent view CP Without Content Field
		|field|Geolocation|
		|fieldFieldLabel|Geolocation|
		|fieldName|Geolocation|
		|webContentTitle|WC WebContent 2 Title|
